    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-ios8">
        <head xml:id="gom-ios8-Hd1e98">Caput 8</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-ios8-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-ios8-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios8-d1e104">
            <pb ed="#P" n="0512A"/>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e108" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios8_1@1-3">Dixit autem Dominus,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios8-Rd1e111"><name xml:id="gom-ios8-Nd1e112" ref="#Origen">ADAM.</name>, hom. 8.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e116"><seg type="qs">Primo propter peccata victi sumus</seg>, etc. usque ad <seg type="qs">qui sequuntur Jesum, ab onere legis.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios8-d1e124">
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios8-Rd1e126" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/ios8_1@1-3"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios8-Rd1e128"><name xml:id="gom-ios8-Nd1e129" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name>, quaest. 10 in Jos.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e133"><seg type="qs">Cum quis justum bellum susceperit</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">non tam auctor belli quam minister judicandus est.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios8-d1e141">
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios8-Rd1e143" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/ios8_1@1-3"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios8-Rd1e145"><name xml:id="gom-ios8-Nd1e146" ref="#Augustine">ID.</name>, quaest. 11.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e150">Quaerendum est utrum omnis fallendi voluntas pro mendacio putanda sit, et si ita est, utrum possit esse justum mendacium, quo ille fallitur qui dignus est falli. Et si non hoc quidem justum reperitur, restat ut secundum aliquam significationem hoc quod de insidiis factum est, ad veritatem referatur.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ios8-Dd1e154">
          <head xml:id="gom-ios8-Hd1e156">Versus 15</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios8-d1e158">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e160" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios8_15@10-11">Et fugientes.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios8-Rd1e163"><name xml:id="gom-ios8-Nd1e164" ref="#Origen">ADAM.</name>, ibid.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e168"><seg type="qs">Quid, <pb ed="#P" n="0512B"/> putas, Jesus fugiens significet?</seg> etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">qui fugiunt fornicationem, dolum, mendacium et hujusmodi.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ios8-Dd1e179">
          <head xml:id="gom-ios8-Hd1e181">Versus 24</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios8-d1e183">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e185" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios8_24@1-3">Igitur omnibus interfectis.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios8-Rd1e188"><name xml:id="gom-ios8-Nd1e189" ref="#Origen">ADAM.</name>, ibid.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e193"><seg type="qs">Percusserunt eos in ore gladii</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">pro palma victoriae et virtutis merito coronari?</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ios8-Dd1e202">
          <head xml:id="gom-ios8-Hd1e204">Versus 29</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios8-d1e206">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e208" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios8_29@1-1">Regem.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios8-Rd1e211"><name xml:id="gom-ios8-Nd1e212" ref="#Origen">ID.</name>, homil. 8.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e216"><seg type="qs">Rex Hai in ligno gemino suspenditur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">de diabolo autem ait: <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e222" source="http://scta.info/resource/Icor15_26@1-5">Novissimus inimicus destruetur mors,</quote> etc. <!--<note>(I Cor. XV.)</note>--></seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios8-d1e228">
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios8-Rd1e230" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/ios8_29@1-1"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios8-Rd1e232"><name xml:id="gom-ios8-Nd1e233" ref="#Origen">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e236"><seg type="qs">LXX: <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e239">In gemino ligno,</quote> hoc est lignum scientiae boni et mali</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">Ipse est novissimus Adam in spiritu vivificante.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ios8-Dd1e248">
          <head xml:id="gom-ios8-Hd1e250">Versus 30</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios8-d1e252">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e254" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios8_30@1-2">Tunc aedificavit,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios8-Rd1e257"><name xml:id="gom-ios8-Nd1e258" ref="#Origen">ADAM.</name>, hom. 9.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e262"><seg type="qs">Aedificavit Jesus altare Domino Deo Israel, etc., <pb ed="#P" n="0512C"/></seg> usque ad <seg type="qs">qui ad altaris constructionem digni sunt.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ios8-Dd1e272">
          <head xml:id="gom-ios8-Hd1e274">Versus 33</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios8-d1e276">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e278" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios8_33@1-2">Omnis autem.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios8-Rd1e281"><name xml:id="gom-ios8-Nd1e282" ref="#Origen">ORIG.</name>, hom. 9.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e286"><seg type="qs">Et omnis Israel et presbyteri</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">implendo scilicet opere quae scripta sunt in lege.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios8-d1e294">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e296" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios8_33@23-24">Ut advena.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios8-Rd1e299"><name xml:id="gom-ios8-Nd1e300" ref="#Origen">ID.</name>, ibid.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e304"><seg type="qs">Sed et proselytus et indigena simul</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et poenas peccatoribus constitutas, caveant incurrere eas.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ios8-Dd1e313">
          <head xml:id="gom-ios8-Hd1e315">Versus 34</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios8-d1e317">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e319" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios8_34@1-3">Post haec legit.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios8-Rd1e322"><name xml:id="gom-ios8-Nd1e323" ref="#Origen">ADAM.</name>, ibid.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e327"><seg type="qs">Refertur</seg>, etc., usque ad: <seg type="qs"><quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e332" source="http://scta.info/resource/Icor2_12@13-20">ut sciamus quae a Deo donata sunt nobis<!-- check: Migne cites IIcor2; text matches Icor2_12 --></quote>.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-ios8-Dd1e339">
          <head xml:id="gom-ios8-Hd1e341">Versus 35</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-ios8-d1e343">
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e345" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/ios8_35@1-3">Nihil ex his.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-ios8-Rd1e348"><name xml:id="gom-ios8-Nd1e349" ref="#Origen">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-ios8-Qd1e352"><seg type="qs">Non erat sermo ex his quae mandavit Moses</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">vel qui jam sociari fidelibus student.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
